#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`mqtt` --- Simple MQTT client"
msgstr ":mod:`mqtt` --- Cliente MQTT simple"

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :mod:`mqtt` module provides a minimal MQTT v3.1.1 client implementation "
"suitable for use on memory-constrained devices. It supports connecting to a "
"broker (with optional TLS), publishing messages, subscribing to topics, "
"last-will configuration and keep-alive pings."
msgstr ""
"El módulo :mod:`mqtt` proporciona una implementación mínima de cliente MQTT "
"v3.1.1 adecuada para su uso en dispositivos con memoria limitada. Admite la "
"conexión a un broker (con TLS opcional), la publicación de mensajes, la "
"suscripción a temas, la configuración de last-will y los pings de keep-"
"alive."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:12
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Ejemplo::"

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:28
msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr "Excepciones"

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:32
msgid ""
"Raised when the broker rejects the CONNECT request or when a SUBSCRIBE "
"request is refused. The single argument is the broker-supplied numeric "
"return code."
msgstr ""
"Se lanza cuando el broker rechaza la solicitud CONNECT o cuando se rechaza "
"una solicitud SUBSCRIBE. El único argumento es el código de retorno numérico"
" proporcionado por el broker."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:37
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Clases"

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:41
msgid "Construct an MQTT client."
msgstr "Construye un cliente MQTT."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:43 ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:77
#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:90 ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:115
msgid "Arguments:"
msgstr "Argumentos:"

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:45
msgid "*client_id* -- unique client identifier sent to the broker."
msgstr "*client_id* -- identificador único de cliente enviado al broker."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:46
msgid ""
"*server* -- broker hostname or IP address (resolved with "
":func:`socket.getaddrinfo`)."
msgstr ""
"*server* -- nombre de host o dirección IP del broker (resuelto con "
":func:`socket.getaddrinfo`)."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:48
msgid ""
"*port* -- broker TCP port (typically ``1883`` plain or ``8883`` for TLS)."
msgstr ""
"*port* -- puerto TCP del broker (normalmente ``1883`` sin cifrar o ``8883`` "
"para TLS)."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:50
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"*ssl_params* -- if not ``None``, the socket is wrapped with "
":func:`ssl.wrap_socket` and *ssl_params* is forwarded as keyword arguments. "
"Pass ``{}`` to enable TLS with defaults."
msgstr ""
"*ssl_params* -- si no es ``None``, el socket se envuelve con "
":func:`ssl.wrap_socket` y *ssl_params* se reenvía como argumentos de palabra"
" clave. Pasa ``{}`` para habilitar TLS con los valores predeterminados."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:53
msgid ""
"*user* -- optional username for broker authentication. If given, *password* "
"must also be supplied."
msgstr ""
"*user* -- nombre de usuario opcional para la autenticación con el broker. Si"
" se proporciona, también debe suministrarse *password*."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:55
msgid "*password* -- optional password used together with *user*."
msgstr "*password* -- contraseña opcional utilizada junto con *user*."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:56
msgid ""
"*keepalive* -- keep-alive interval in seconds (``0`` disables). Must be less"
" than ``65536``."
msgstr ""
"*keepalive* -- intervalo de keep-alive en segundos (``0`` lo desactiva). "
"Debe ser menor que ``65536``."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:58
msgid ""
"*callback* -- callable invoked as ``callback(topic, msg)`` for each PUBLISH "
"delivered from the broker. May also be set later with :meth:`set_callback`."
msgstr ""
"*callback* -- invocable llamado como ``callback(topic, msg)`` por cada "
"PUBLISH entregado desde el broker. También puede establecerse más tarde con "
":meth:`set_callback`."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:63
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "Métodos"

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:67
msgid ""
"Set the callback invoked by :meth:`wait_msg` and :meth:`check_msg` when a "
"PUBLISH message is received. The callback is called as ``f(topic, msg)`` "
"with both arguments as :class:`bytes`."
msgstr ""
"Establece la función de retorno (callback) invocada por :meth:`wait_msg` y "
":meth:`check_msg` cuando se recibe un mensaje PUBLISH. La función de retorno"
" se llama como ``f(topic, msg)`` con ambos argumentos como :class:`bytes`."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:73
msgid ""
"Configure the MQTT Last Will and Testament. The broker publishes *msg* on "
"*topic* if the client disconnects ungracefully. Must be called before "
":meth:`connect`."
msgstr ""
"Configura el Last Will and Testament de MQTT. El broker publica *msg* en "
"*topic* si el cliente se desconecta de forma anómala. Debe llamarse antes de"
" :meth:`connect`."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:79
msgid "*topic* -- last-will topic (must be non-empty)."
msgstr "*topic* -- tema del last-will (no debe estar vacío)."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:80
msgid "*msg* -- last-will payload."
msgstr "*msg* -- carga útil del last-will."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:81
msgid ""
"*retain* -- if ``True``, broker stores the will message as a retained "
"message."
msgstr ""
"*retain* -- si es ``True``, el broker almacena el mensaje de will como un "
"mensaje retenido."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:83
msgid "*qos* -- last-will QoS level. Must be ``0``, ``1`` or ``2``."
msgstr "*qos* -- nivel de QoS del last-will. Debe ser ``0``, ``1`` o ``2``."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:87
msgid ""
"Open a TCP (and optionally TLS) connection to the broker and send a CONNECT "
"packet."
msgstr ""
"Abre una conexión TCP (y opcionalmente TLS) con el broker y envía un paquete"
" CONNECT."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:92
msgid ""
"*clean_session* -- if ``True``, request a clean session; otherwise the "
"broker resumes any prior session state."
msgstr ""
"*clean_session* -- si es ``True``, solicita una sesión limpia; en caso "
"contrario, el broker reanuda cualquier estado de sesión anterior."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:94
msgid ""
"*timeout* -- socket timeout in seconds applied to the underlying socket."
msgstr ""
"*timeout* -- tiempo de espera del socket en segundos aplicado al socket "
"subyacente."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:97
msgid ""
"Returns the broker's *session present* flag (``0`` or ``1``). Raises "
":exc:`MQTTException` if the broker returns a non-zero CONNACK return code."
msgstr ""
"Devuelve el indicador *session present* del broker (``0`` o ``1``). Lanza "
":exc:`MQTTException` si el broker devuelve un código de retorno CONNACK "
"distinto de cero."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:103
msgid "Send a DISCONNECT packet and close the underlying socket."
msgstr "Envía un paquete DISCONNECT y cierra el socket subyacente."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:107
msgid ""
"Send a PINGREQ packet to the broker. Should be called periodically if "
"*keepalive* is non-zero so the broker does not drop the connection."
msgstr ""
"Envía un paquete PINGREQ al broker. Debe llamarse periódicamente si "
"*keepalive* es distinto de cero para que el broker no cierre la conexión."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:113
msgid "Publish *msg* to *topic*."
msgstr "Publica *msg* en *topic*."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:117
msgid "*topic* -- topic name to publish to."
msgstr "*topic* -- nombre del tema en el que publicar."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:118
msgid "*msg* -- payload bytes."
msgstr "*msg* -- bytes de la carga útil."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:119
msgid ""
"*retain* -- if ``True``, instruct the broker to retain the message for new "
"subscribers."
msgstr ""
"*retain* -- si es ``True``, indica al broker que retenga el mensaje para los"
" nuevos suscriptores."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:121
msgid ""
"*qos* -- quality-of-service level. ``0`` (fire and forget) and ``1`` "
"(acknowledged) are supported. ``2`` is not implemented and will raise "
":exc:`AssertionError`."
msgstr ""
"*qos* -- nivel de calidad de servicio. Se admiten ``0`` (enviar y olvidar) y"
" ``1`` (con confirmación). ``2`` no está implementado y lanzará "
":exc:`AssertionError`."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:125
msgid ""
"For *qos* ``1``, the call blocks until the matching PUBACK is received. The "
"total packet size must be less than ``2097152`` bytes."
msgstr ""
"Para *qos* ``1``, la llamada se bloquea hasta que se recibe el PUBACK "
"correspondiente. El tamaño total del paquete debe ser menor que ``2097152`` "
"bytes."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:131
msgid ""
"Subscribe to *topic* at the given *qos* level. A callback must have been "
"registered via :meth:`set_callback` or supplied to the constructor; "
"otherwise :exc:`AssertionError` is raised."
msgstr ""
"Se suscribe a *topic* en el nivel *qos* indicado. Debe haberse registrado "
"una función de retorno mediante :meth:`set_callback` o suministrado al "
"constructor; de lo contrario se lanza :exc:`AssertionError`."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:135
msgid ""
"Blocks until the matching SUBACK is received. Raises :exc:`MQTTException` if"
" the broker refuses the subscription (return code ``0x80``)."
msgstr ""
"Se bloquea hasta que se recibe el SUBACK correspondiente. Lanza "
":exc:`MQTTException` si el broker rechaza la suscripción (código de retorno "
"``0x80``)."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:141
msgid ""
"Block waiting for a single incoming MQTT packet and process it. PUBLISH "
"packets are delivered to the registered callback. PINGRESP packets are "
"consumed silently. For other control packets the raw first byte is returned."
" Returns ``None`` if no data is available or if a PINGRESP was processed."
msgstr ""
"Se bloquea esperando un único paquete MQTT entrante y lo procesa. Los "
"paquetes PUBLISH se entregan a la función de retorno registrada. Los "
"paquetes PINGRESP se consumen silenciosamente. Para otros paquetes de "
"control se devuelve el primer byte sin procesar. Devuelve ``None`` si no hay"
" datos disponibles o si se procesó un PINGRESP."

#: ../../library/omv.mqtt.rst:149
msgid ""
"Non-blocking variant of :meth:`wait_msg`. Polls the socket for at most ~50 "
"ms using :func:`select.select`; if data is pending it performs the same "
"processing as :meth:`wait_msg`, otherwise returns ``None``."
msgstr ""
"Variante no bloqueante de :meth:`wait_msg`. Sondea el socket durante un "
"máximo de ~50 ms usando :func:`select.select`; si hay datos pendientes "
"realiza el mismo procesamiento que :meth:`wait_msg`, de lo contrario "
"devuelve ``None``."
